				<rdf:Alt>
					<rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MC9S08QE128, MC9S08QE96, and MC9S08QE64 are members of the low-cost, low-power, high-performance S08 Family of 8-bit microcontroller units (MCUs). All MCUs in the family use the enhanced S08 core and are available with a variety of modules, memory sizes, memory types, and package types. This device has 131,072 bytes of Flash.</rdf:li>
